# Pnpm Configuration: Architectural Hoisting
# These patterns ensure core "singletons" are visible to Metro without global hoisting (*).

public-hoist-pattern[]=*@tanstack/query-core*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*@react-navigation/*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*expo-modules-core*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*@expo/config*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*@expo/config-plugins*
